---
title: "Green Protein Smoothie"
summary: "The way a smoothie really should be made …."
publishedDate: 2026-06-16
heroImage: /images/recipes/green-protein-smoothie.webp
pillar: blood-sugar
cta: book-consult
servings: "1"
ingredients:
  - "1 cup almond, hemp or coconut milk"
  - "3 strawberries"
  - "1/2 avocado"
  - "1/3 cup frozen kale"
  - "1/3 cup frozen cauliflower rice"
  - "1 Tbsp almond butter"
  - "1 Tbsp hemp seeds"
  - "1 scoop favorite protein powder (I love PaleoValley and Epic)"
  - "Additional water as needed"
steps:
  - "Combine all ingredients except water in a blender, blend on high."
  - "Add additional water as needed to reach desired consistency."
legacyUrl: /treats/green-protein-smoothie
---

This is my favorite go-to summer smoothie recipe. I find that it’s easy to make smoothies with just fruit, and while that tastes delicious, it’s important to balance the sweetness with veggies, healthy fats, and protein. This is a great mid-morning or afternoon snack, especially if you find yourself mindlessly munching (or reaching for that chocolate chip cookie)….
